1. Initialisation

git clone https://github.com/nvnenasheva/trailflow.git
cd trialflow
python -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -U pip


2. Create project (basic structure)

mkdir -p src/trialflow app tests notebooks data docker .github/workflows .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE
touch src/trialflow/{__init__.py,features.py,train.py,evaluate.py,policy.py,serve.py,app_demo.py,ingest_fhir.py}
touch tests/{test_features.py,test_metrics.py}
touch the other files ...

3. Run local demo
API:
    make api        # поднимает FastAPI на http://127.0.0.1:8000
UI:
    make app        # запускает Streamlit клиент
Check health:
    GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health  -> {"status":"ok"}

